    "Since each contract can cover any area (unlimited capacity), can the company split a single month's requirement across multiple contracts of different lengths (e.g., part of month 1's 1500㎡ from a 2-month contract and the rest from a 3-month contract), or must each month's requirement be covered by a single contract?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding whether monthly requirements can be split across multiple contracts or must be covered by one, which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

